  "description": "Cha Hyun-jin, a so-called successful model, has recently been troubled by something. Ever since he slept with Kang Seung-jun—who claimed to be a fan and suddenly acted as if he knew him—he hasn’t been able to have satisfying sex.\n\nWith his only escape from insomnia now gone, Hyun-jin was spending his days in a state of stress when, suddenly, the memory of his last encounter with Seung-jun came flooding back…\n\n*“I’ll just meet him one more time, sort things out neatly, and be done with it.”*\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062215), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/first_side), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Crossing_that_line)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://honto.jp/ebook/pd-series_C-MBJ-21782-6-617566X.html)",
